<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were fully $1.00, instances 1.50, lower. Demand light, with some buyers getting out of the market. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  59.00-60.00, liberal volume 59.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  58.00-59.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to weak. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs.  42.00-44.00, few 45.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs.  44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  46.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs.  48.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
</text>
